1
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:02,240
Reading Task

2
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:05,920
A Follower of Bill Gates

3
00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:10,620
I have been a friend of Bill Gates for a long time.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,680
I knew him when he was a student at Harvard University.

5
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:21,440
We were surprised when he left University to set up his own company "Microsoft"

6
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:23,300
and make his own software.

7
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,940
But he was the clever one!

8
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:34,120
He is very good at writing computer languages and almost all computers now use Microsoft software.

9
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:39,040
The program "Word" is used from Britain to China!

10
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:44,520
Of course he has made a lot of money and that makes people very jealous (妒忌的).

11
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:47,100
They want to stop his success.

12
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:53,160
Even the government is against him and has tried to break his company into two parts.

13
00:00:53,860 --> 00:00:59,380
They say that he is unfair to other people who want to sell similar software.

14
00:01:00,240 --> 00:01:04,620
Because he fits his new software free in every new computer,

15
00:01:05,060 --> 00:01:10,120
the government says he is stopping other companies from selling their programs.

16
00:01:10,860 --> 00:01:12,260
This is not fair.

17
00:01:12,860 --> 00:01:17,420
Everyone should be able to do what they can to make their company bigger.

18
00:01:18,220 --> 00:01:22,720
Bill Gates has only done what he can to stop other competitors(竞争对手).

19
00:01:23,780 --> 00:01:26,520
He is very rich, but he is generous.

20
00:01:27,180 --> 00:01:33,760
He has given millions of dollars to help the education and health of many children around the world.

21
00:01:34,420 --> 00:01:37,700
You could not meet a better man than Bill Gates.

22
00:01:39,300 --> 00:01:45,480
A COMPETITOR OF BILL GATES Bill Gates has been very successful

23
00:01:45,480 --> 00:01:47,160
and become very rich.

24
00:01:47,820 --> 00:01:51,020
He is very generous but how has he got his money?

25
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:55,920
He has done this by making sure that no one else will be able to compete

26
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:57,000
with (竞争) his software.

27
00:01:57,780 --> 00:02:02,900
His software is not the best but it is used most widely in the world.

28
00:02:02,900 --> 00:02:05,080
When he sees what is needed,

29
00:02:05,880 --> 00:02:10,180
he makes a program and produces it quicker than anybody else.

30
00:02:10,260 --> 00:02:13,880
That way he gets a large part of the software market.

31
00:02:14,860 --> 00:02:17,760
Then he works on improving the software later.

32
00:02:18,460 --> 00:02:21,440
He tries hard to stop others making better software.

33
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:27,060
In 1995 the government tried to make things fairer for people like me.

34
00:02:27,310 --> 00:02:31,900
The government wanted to make Microsoft into two companies so

35
00:02:31,900 --> 00:02:34,880
that neither of them was so strong nor so rich.

36
00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:39,420
This meant that they could not stop somebody else making new software.

37
00:02:40,260 --> 00:02:43,980
I always wonder how he could get so rich so quickly.

38
00:02:44,720 --> 00:02:46,540
Has he done it by fair means?

39
00:02:46,540 --> 00:02:50,100
Or has he done it by being a computer bully (霸) ?
